  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging Local Capacity to Strengthen Health Service Delivery Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this APS is to contribute to the Agency&apos;s strategic priorities of 1) Preventing child and maternal deaths; 2) Combating infectious diseases and 3) achieving HIV epidemic control in Malawi while advancing Malawi&apos;s journey to self-reliance through local partner engagement in implementation of health and social welfare programming.</narrative>
  </description>
